Product UX bundles independently usable requirements, UX and site-delivery workflows.

Android design guidance generalizes practices from moon-research's Pomodrone
designer/lab collaboration. The app's source, assets, private captures and
project-specific defaults are not bundled.

Coordination refinements also adapt ideas from
https://github.com/TadasValaitiz/room-graph-orchestration.
