The site-building, content, Analytics and publishing guidance was generalized
from the AppFX collaboration and moon-research's Product Graph site playbook.
Customer branding, credentials, account IDs and private research are not
distributed as plugin defaults. Superdesign, Cloudflare, Firebase, Claude and
Codex are separate products; this package does not bundle their services.
